# CakePHP AI

Prefer `docs/migration-plans/` + the `ai-sdk-development` skill. **Alpha** (`Crustum\Ai\*`).

@scoped(['config/ai.php'])
## AI config
- Configure providers and defaults via env/Configure — never commit secrets.
- Enable only drivers that exist in this package version.
@endscoped

@scoped(['src/Ai/Agents/**'])
## Agents
- Bake with `bake agent`; implement Agent + `PromptableTrait`; add tools via `HasTools` when needed.
- Prefer `prompt` / stream / queue APIs that exist in the package; use `Agent::make()` for DI.
@endscoped

@scoped(['src/Ai/Tools/**', 'src/Ai/Middleware/**'])
## Tools & middleware
- Bake tools/middleware; keep `description` / `schema` / `handle` aligned with MCP-style contracts where shared.
- MCP-backed tools need a working `crustum/mcp` server registration.
@endscoped

@scoped(['tests/**'])
## AI tests
- Prefer package fakes (`::fake`, `assertPrompted`, prevent stray calls) when available.
@endscoped
